  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_002",
    "basic": {
      "name": "函数的单调性",
      "type": "definition",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "函数值随自变量的增大而增大（或减小）的性质叫做函数的单调性。单调性是用符号语言精确刻画函数图象的升降特征。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 5,
      "exam_frequency": 5
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_003",
    "basic": {
      "name": "单调递增的严格定义",
      "type": "definition",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "设函数f(x)的定义域为I，区间D⊆I。如果∀x₁,x₂∈D，当x₁<x₂时，都有f(x₁)<f(x₂)，那么就称函数f(x)在区间D上单调递增。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 4,
      "exam_frequency": 4
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_004",
    "basic": {
      "name": "单调递减的严格定义",
      "type": "definition",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "设函数f(x)的定义域为I，区间D⊆I。如果∀x₁,x₂∈D，当x₁<x₂时，都有f(x₁)>f(x₂)，那么就称函数f(x)在区间D上单调递减。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 4,
      "exam_frequency": 4
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_005",
    "basic": {
      "name": "增函数与减函数",
      "type": "definition",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "当函数f(x)在它的定义域上单调递增时，称它是增函数（increasing function）；当函数f(x)在它的定义域上单调递减时，称它是减函数（decreasing function）。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 3,
      "exam_frequency": 3
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_006",
    "basic": {
      "name": "单调区间",
      "type": "definition",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "如果函数y=f(x)在区间D上单调递增或单调递减，那么就说函数在这一区间具有（严格的）单调性，区间D叫做y=f(x)的单调区间。单调性是函数在定义域内某个区间上的局部性质。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 3,
      "exam_frequency": 3
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_007",
    "basic": {
      "name": "单调性的证明方法（作差法）",
      "type": "method",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "证明步骤：①在区间上任取x₁,x₂且x₁<x₂；②作差f(x₁)-f(x₂)；③对差值进行因式分解或变形；④根据条件判断差值的符号；⑤得出f(x₁)<f(x₂)或f(x₁)>f(x₂)的结论，从而确定单调性。关键是比较f(x₁)-f(x₂)与0的大小关系。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 5,
      "exam_frequency": 5
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_008",
    "basic": {
      "name": "一次函数的单调性",
      "type": "example",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "对于一次函数f(x)=kx+b(k≠0)，当k>0时，f(x)是增函数；当k<0时，f(x)是减函数。通过作差法f(x₁)-f(x₂)=k(x₁-x₂)，由k的符号判断差值符号。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 2,
      "exam_frequency": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_009",
    "basic": {
      "name": "反比例函数的单调性（玻意耳定律）",
      "type": "example",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "对于反比例函数p=k/V(V>0)，通过作差法可证明其在(0,+∞)上是减函数。即当体积V减小时，压强p增大。函数y=k/x在(-∞,0)上单调递增，在(0,+∞)上单调递减。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 2,
      "exam_frequency": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_010",
    "basic": {
      "name": "函数的最大值定义",
      "type": "definition",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "设函数y=f(x)的定义域为I，如果存在实数M满足：①∀x∈I，都有f(x)≤M；②∃x₀∈I，使得f(x₀)=M。那么称M是函数y=f(x)的最大值。两个条件缺一不可：上界性和可达性。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 4,
      "exam_frequency": 4
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_011",
    "basic": {
      "name": "函数的最小值定义",
      "type": "definition",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "设函数y=f(x)的定义域为I，如果存在实数M满足：①∀x∈I，都有f(x)≥M；②∃x₀∈I，使得f(x₀)=M。那么称M是函数y=f(x)的最小值。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 4,
      "exam_frequency": 4
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_012",
    "basic": {
      "name": "二次函数求最值（公式法）",
      "type": "method",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "对于二次函数f(x)=ax²+bx+c(a≠0)，顶点横坐标x=-b/(2a)，此时函数取得最值f= (4ac-b²)/(4a)。当a<0时取得最大值，当a>0时取得最小值。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 4,
      "exam_frequency": 4
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_013",
    "basic": {
      "name": "闭区间上利用单调性求最值",
      "type": "method",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "若函数在闭区间[a,b]上单调递减，则最大值在左端点x=a处取得，最小值在右端点x=b处取得；若单调递增则相反。先证明函数的单调性，再代入端点计算。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 4,
      "exam_frequency": 4
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_014",
    "basic": {
      "name": "偶函数的概念",
      "type": "definition",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "设函数f(x)的定义域为I，如果∀x∈I，都有-x∈I，且f(-x)=f(x)，那么函数f(x)就叫做偶函数（even function）。偶函数的图象关于y轴对称。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 4,
      "exam_frequency": 4
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_015",
    "basic": {
      "name": "奇函数的概念",
      "type": "definition",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "设函数f(x)的定义域为I，如果∀x∈I，都有-x∈I，且f(-x)=-f(x)，那么函数f(x)就叫做奇函数（odd function）。奇函数的图象关于原点成中心对称。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 4,
      "exam_frequency": 4
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_016",
    "basic": {
      "name": "函数奇偶性的判断方法",
      "type": "method",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "步骤：①确定函数的定义域，判断其是否关于原点对称（∀x∈I,-x∈I）；若不对称则为非奇非偶函数；②计算f(-x)；③若f(-x)=f(x)则为偶函数，若f(-x)=-f(x)则为奇函数，若两者都不是则为非奇非偶函数。奇偶性是函数的整体性质。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "relations": {
      "reference": [],
      "related": []
    },
    "importance": {
      "curriculum_weight": 4,
      "exam_frequency": 4
    }
  },
  {
    "knowledge_id": "math_10_ch3_s2_017",
    "basic": {
      "name": "奇偶性的图象特征",
      "type": "property",
      "subject": "数学",
      "stage": "高中",
      "grade": "必修第一册",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
    "tree": {
      "parent_id": null,
      "path": []
    },
    "concept": {
      "source_text": "偶函数的图象关于y轴对称；奇函数的图象关于原点成中心对称。利用奇偶性可以简化函数研究：已知函数在y轴一侧的图象，可由对称性推出另一侧的图象。",
      "level": "knowledge"
    },
